stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> ParamUpdateRequested: Main thread sets parameter via CLAP
    ParamUpdateRequested --> Enqueuing: Main thread pushes ParamAtom to SPSC ring
    Enqueuing --> Enqueued: SPSC ring push succeeds
    Enqueued --> Processing: Audio thread pops ParamAtom from ring
    Processing --> Applied: Audio thread applies parameter to internal state
    Applied --> [*]
    
    %% Handle full buffer case
    Enqueuing --> BufferFull: SPSC ring is full
    BufferFull --> Dropped: Main thread drops oldest param or new param (policy)
    Dropped --> [*]
    
    %% Handle spurious wakeups or errors
    Processing --> Error: Pop failed (should not happen in correct implementation)
    Error --> [*]